[b]A simulator of a businessman on the Japanese stock market in the 80s and 90s. Chill, catch a retro vibe, and watch your profits grow in the text-based game STONKS-9800.[/b]

[b]Add to wishlist:[/b]
https://store.steampowered.com/app/1539140/STONKS9800/
[h2]Features:[/h2]
- Buy stocks, get dividends, monitor the stock price;
- Your actions affect the market;
- Keep an eye on your health and do not overwork, lest you end up in the hospital;
- Take care of a lot of problems;
- Buy your own real estate and cars, increasing your level of comfort;
- Manage the company, having a controlling interest;
- The opportunity to earn not only the legal way;
- Mini-games: pachinko and betting on horse races;
- Many other features and unexpected situations await you in [b]STONKS-9800[/b].

Hi! This is small update that cleans bugs after the last major update. Also for those who find the game too hard or too easy - you can change the difficulty in the options of the main menu.

- Fixed bug with crash game on "ENG ENG" spell;
- Added levels of difficulty in Options Menu;
- Fixed some minor bugs.

New game update, which was created during the development of console version.

What is new:
- A new track in battles;
- Heroes do not die instantly, it is possible to resurrect them;
- Accordingly, the game now has the Resurrection Potions;
- Small changes in the color of the interface;
- Visual character sprites update;
- Heroes no longer restore their strength on rest without food;
- Brief help on F1 and more hints;
- Story is no longer skipped one click at a time;
- Improved support for gamepads;
- Rebalance.

Thank you for playing my game! I will be happy to hear from you.
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33572395/d3be75abea037ce1e6ea5648a5f895c3df97dfd3.png[/img]

Mini update. There'll be more soon!

- The time limit during the fear effect has been increased;
- Fixed "33 food" achievement (now working);
- Shields and other effects now disappear when a character dies;
- After the death of a character, you can't click on the character;
- Information about the characters in battle is now more clearly visible.

After the release I got some more very useful feedback, based on which I made some small updates.

[b]List of changes:[/b]
- The normal difficulty mode now shows you the walls in the dungeon, making it easier to navigate;
- Cell with boss now has a special icon, after its exploration;
- When selecting a hero, you can now see his basic attack power;
- Fixed a lot of buggies (really a lot).

In future updates I will try to add more hints in the control and explanation of the mechanic of the game.

New game mode "[b]Dark Forest[/b]' and new boss and hero — Witch.
[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/33572395/68955b0f487bdaf927542341f3614e392e6f351c.gif[/img]
Four brave heroes journeyed to explore the mysterious dense forest. Many legends tell about mysterious events happening here.
All kinds of evildoers have been living here for many years, and the heroes have to find out who is behind all this.

Complete "Dark Forest" and get a new hero [b]Witch[/b]!

[b]Update 0.3 include:[/b]
- New Game Mode "Dark Forest";
- New Hero Witch;
- New Boss Witch;
- 3 new enemies;
- 1 new spell;
- Bug fixes.

First regular update for game in [b]Early Access[/b]!

Nexoria 0.2 ~new stories~ :
- new random events in the dungeons;
- three new enemies;
- two new bosses;
- a new type of dungeon;
- one new soundtrack for battle;
- balance fixes;
- intro with a short history;
- removing spells now adds knowledge points;
- three new spells (+1 hidden);
- more floors, but they are smaller;
- bug fixes.

What to expect next? So far, the [b]roadmap [/b]is as follows:
- new game modes;
- more plot;
- quests inside dungeons, giving useful skills and properties;
- global upgrade for the whole squad;
- random (or not) bonuses at the beginning of the game;
- more events, bosses and enemies.

Look at the alternative history of Taimumari! What if the main character of the story is Kanashi? And who will be a villain?
https://store.steampowered.com/app/998580/Taimumari_Kanashimi_mode/
[b]Play a familiar game with new features![/b]
[list]
